{
  "name": "escalate_out_of_scope_request",
  "description": "Use when a client asks for work that falls outside what they're contracted for. Texts the client three options — book a call, go ahead anyway, or skip it — and hands the decision to them (with a 30-minute SLA that defaults to booking a call if they don't reply). Do NOT just do out-of-scope work, and do not decide FOR the client — this tool is how you hand the choice back to them properly.",
